Package: openmux-factory-tools
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: OpenMux <support@openmux.io>
Homepage: https://github.com/OpenMux
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: usbutils, python3-serial
Description: OpenMux factory provisioning and test tools
 Standalone factory utilities for the OpenMux console: programming the
 internal/external FTDI EEPROM (manufacturer, product, serial base),
 listing detected FTDI consoles, a serial loopback test and the board
 test runner. Installed on the install medium (used from the factory
 menu) and on the target (kept for field service).
